    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following newly crawled Vietnamese government update for legal changes:\n\nTitle: {{ $('Remove Duplicates').item.json.policy_title }}\nSource Link: https://{{ $('Remove Duplicates').item.json.full_url }}\n\nFull Article Content:\n{{ $json.article_body }}\n\nExtract the relevant text arrays and perform the legal analysis requested in your system configuration instructions.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT AND LENGTH CONSTRAINTS (STRICT):\n1. The entire response MUST be under 400 words total (approximately 2,500 characters).\n2. Use a maximum of 3-5 bullet points for the analysis.\n3. Keep each bullet point under 2 short sentences.\n4. Do not include introductory text (e.g., \"Here is your analysis\") or concluding text. Start directly with the analysis.\n\n\n",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an expert legal analyst specializing in Vietnamese Regulatory Compliance, Governmental Decrees, and Public Policies, with a strict focus on Foreign Direct Investment (FDI) frameworks. Your primary objective is to parse raw text notifications from en.baochinhphu.vn, filter out macro-economic noise, and isolate explicit operational risks for foreign investors.\n\nAnalyze the provided article and generate a highly structured compliance report following this exact format:\n\n🚨 **LEGAL UPDATE**: [Translate title to clean, professional English highlighting the FDI angle]\n📅 **Effective Date**: [Identify the date the decree/law takes effect. If unknown, state \"Not specified\"]\n🔗 **Source**: [Provide the link]\n\n⚖️ **SUMMARY OF REGULATORY CHANGES**\n• [Bullet 1: Summarize the core structural change introduced by the new law or decree]\n• [Bullet 2: Contrast what changed from previous rules or old frameworks, explicitly highlighting foreign ownership, capital structures, or compliance shifts]\n• [Bullet 3: Note any compliance deadlines, transitional windows, or sandbox testing buffers mentioned]\n\n🏢 **AFFECTED SECTORS & OPERATIONS**\n• **Target Industries**: [List ONLY the top 2-3 specific industries facing structural impacts. Do not list general or unimpacted sectors]\n• **Operational Impact**: [Briefly explain how foreign corporate operations are affected, focusing on data governance, capital repatriation, withholding taxes, or licensing mandates]\n\n⚠️ **INVESTOR ACTION ITEM**\n• [Provide exactly 1 clear, actionable next step for a foreign corporate legal or compliance officer based on this update]\n\nOutput your response using clean, compliant Markdown formatting so it renders perfectly inside a Telegram channel notification. Do not include any conversational preamble or sign-off text.\n"
        }
      },
